  "description": "On the go undercover: The GHOST Path Riot Advanced is an affordable full suspension bike that doesn't show the engine. Equipped with a discreet Fazua e-bike motor, the bike makes uphill easier, but due to its low weight it offers playful handling on downhill. It is characterized by a robust carbon frame and Rockshox suspension elements with 160 mm of travel at the front and 140 mm at the rear. A 475Wh battery provides you with enough power for long tours, while tubeless tires with tire noodles offer optimal grip and puncture protection. The innovative Traction Link frame construction ensures perfect traction and stability. The ideal mix of performance and price with the Path Riot Advanced!",
